    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/111aea89-2a2b-419e-b76f-e306d669fed1.png\" style=\"width:2.44028in;height:1.67986in\" /><br />Slope of <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Slope of <math><mi>B</mi><mi>I</mi></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Slope of <math><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br />Let, the slopes of <math><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></math> are <math><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> &amp; <math><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> respectively<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub